title: RiverReflection
---
//After having defeated the Rattling Medusa, event staring into the water
You stare into the River, now still as ever.
Your reflection looks back at you through warm ripples.
Your fur still stands on end.

//-------------------------------
    ->What was that?
        <<jump Whatwasthat>>
//-------------------------------
    ->That was exciting
        <<jump Thatwasexciting>>
//-------------------------------
    ->Who are you?
        <<jump whoareyou1>>
===

title: Whatwasthat
---
You can't even hazard a guess.
You've read about some of the local fauna-flora in books, but...
Never had a creature like that ever crossed your mind as possible.
Although you're not much of one to talk.
Maybe Pepper's words hold more weight than you want to believe.
You think of the upcoming journey...
You imagine countless, dangerous splatters of ink...
You groom your tail. It's time to move on.
===

title: Thatwasexciting
---
It was, wasn't it?
To think earlier today you were dreading leaving the house.
Through the unnatural cold, your blood was burning.
Never had a creature like that ever crossed your mind as possible...
But you overcame it.
Those sleepy villagers can have their peace and quiet.
This is far more interesting than farm and family!
You imagine a world larger than you could imagine...
You groom your tail. It's time to move on.
===

title: whoareyou1
---
Harte, an Otter, 18. A wanderer of some sort. More open-minded than before.
You like flowers and fishing.
An alligator taught you to appreciate the scenery.
Your whiskers are soaked with riverspray.
Your tail twitches at the thought of continuing. You don't know what that means.
Everything is up in the air.
...Why would you ask that?
You groom your tail. It's time to move on.
===